---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const liveDemoUrl = '/demo/landing-page/';
---

<Layout
	title="Landing Page Design & Development Demo | Lakmuthu Studio"
	description="A demonstration of the focused, responsive marketing landing pages Lakmuthu Studio can design and build."
	image="/images/landing_demo.png"
>
	<section class="project-hero">
		<div class="wrap project-hero-grid">
			<div>
				<a class="back-link" href="/#work">← Back to work examples</a>
				<span class="eyebrow">Landing page demo</span>
				<h1>A polished landing page built to explain one offer clearly.</h1>
				<p class="project-lede">
					This demo shows the kind of complete marketing page I can design and build:
					clear messaging, strong visual hierarchy, responsive layouts, purposeful
					interaction, and calls to action that guide visitors naturally.
				</p>
				<div class="project-actions">
					<a class="btn btn-primary" href={liveDemoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View live demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/#contact">Discuss a similar project</a>
				</div>
				<p class="demo-note">The course is fictional and is used only as realistic sample content for the landing-page build.</p>
			</div>

			<dl class="project-facts" aria-label="Project details">
				<div><dt>Deliverable</dt><dd>Complete marketing page</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Capabilities</dt><dd>Design and front-end development</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Page strategy</dt><dd>Single-offer conversion journey</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Experience</dt><dd>Responsive and interactive</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="project-showcase">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="browser-frame">
				<div class="browser-bar" aria-hidden="true">
					<span></span><span></span><span></span>
					<div>proofandpractice.demo</div>
				</div>
				<button class="preview-trigger" type="button" aria-label="Open a clean full-screen view of the landing page">
					<img
						src="/images/landing_demo.png"
						alt="Desktop view of the Proof and Practice online-course landing page"
						width="1900"
						height="965"
					/>
					<span class="preview-hint">View clean preview <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
				</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<dialog class="preview-dialog" aria-label="Landing page clean preview">
		<div class="preview-toolbar">
			<p>Landing page demo</p>
			<button class="preview-close" type="button" aria-label="Close preview">Close <span aria-hidden="true">×</span></button>
		</div>
		<div class="preview-canvas">
			<img
				src="/images/landing_demo.png"
				alt="Full clean view of the Proof and Practice online-course landing page"
				width="1900"
				height="965"
			/>
		</div>
	</dialog>

	<section class="project-content">
		<div class="wrap project-content-grid">
			<div class="section-head">
				<span class="eyebrow">What I built</span>
				<h2>A complete page, not just a polished hero.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="project-copy">
				<p class="project-intro">
					This project demonstrates how I turn a detailed offer into a focused, easy-to-follow
					page—from the first headline through supporting information, pricing, FAQs, and
					the final call to action.
				</p>
				<p>
					I created the visual direction, content hierarchy, reusable sections, responsive
					behavior, navigation, expandable FAQs, and safe demo interactions. The result is
					a long-form page that stays readable, intentional, and easy to scan.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="project-features">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="section-head compact-head">
				<span class="eyebrow">What it demonstrates</span>
				<h2>A complete landing-page experience</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-cards">
				<article>
					<span>01</span>
					<h3>Message hierarchy</h3>
					<p>Headlines, supporting copy, proof points, and calls to action are arranged so visitors understand the offer without hunting for information.</p>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span>02</span>
					<h3>Custom visual direction</h3>
					<p>Editorial typography, warm colors, photography, spacing, and small graphic details create a distinctive design instead of a generic template.</p>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span>03</span>
					<h3>Responsive front-end build</h3>
					<p>Navigation, content grids, imagery, FAQ controls, and calls to action adapt cleanly from desktop to mobile.</p>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span>04</span>
					<h3>Complete interaction states</h3>
					<p>Menus, expandable answers, anchored navigation, hover states, and demo-safe inquiry actions make the page feel finished and usable.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="project-cta">
		<div class="wrap">
			<div class="project-cta-card">
				<div>
					<span class="eyebrow">Explore the build</span>
					<h2>See the full page in action.</h2>
					<p>Open the responsive build, or get in touch to discuss a landing page designed around your own offer and audience.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="project-actions">
					<a class="btn btn-primary" href={liveDemoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View live demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/#contact">Start a conversation</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<script>
	const previewDialog = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>('.preview-dialog');
	const previewTrigger = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.preview-trigger');
	const previewClose = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.preview-close');

	previewTrigger?.addEventListener('click', () => previewDialog?.showModal());
	previewClose?.addEventListener('click', () => previewDialog?.close());

	previewDialog?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
		if (event.target === previewDialog) previewDialog.close();
	});
</script>

<style>
	.project-hero { padding: 96px 0 76px; }
	.project-hero-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(260px, .65fr);
		gap: clamp(52px, 8vw, 100px);
		align-items: end;
	}
	.back-link {
		display: block;
		width: fit-content;
		margin-bottom: 34px;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		font-size: .88rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.back-link:hover { color: var(--blue); }
	h1 {
		max-width: 850px;
		font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.3rem);
		line-height: .98;
		letter-spacing: -.05em;
	}
	.project-lede {
		max-width: 660px;
		margin-top: 26px;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.project-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}
	.demo-note {
		margin-top: 18px;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		font-size: .78rem;
	}
	.project-facts {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 8px 28px;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		background: rgba(255,255,255,.66);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	}
	.project-facts div { padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.project-facts div:last-child { border: 0; }
	.project-facts dt {
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		font-size: .72rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: .08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.project-facts dd {
		margin: 5px 0 0;
		color: var(--blue-deep);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.project-showcase { padding: 0 0 108px; }
	.browser-frame {
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid rgba(11,36,71,.16);
		border-radius: 18px;
		background: #fff;
		box-shadow: 0 32px 80px -42px rgba(11,36,71,.7);
	}
	.browser-bar {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 7px;
		height: 46px;
		padding: 0 16px;
		background: #f1ebe3;
	}
	.browser-bar > span { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d6cabe; }
	.browser-bar > span:first-child { background: #ee7761; }
	.browser-bar > span:nth-child(2) { background: #e8a33d; }
	.browser-bar > span:nth-child(3) { background: #63ad81; }
	.browser-bar div {
		margin-left: 10px;
		padding: 5px 16px;
		border-radius: 7px;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
		color: #68777b;
		font-size: .7rem;
	}
	.browser-frame img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
	.preview-trigger {
		position: relative;
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		padding: 0;
		border: 0;
		background: #fff;
		cursor: zoom-in;
	}
	.preview-hint {
		position: absolute;
		right: 18px;
		bottom: 18px;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 10px 15px;
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
		background: rgba(11,36,71,.92);
		color: #fff;
		font-size: .78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
		transition: transform .2s ease, background-color .2s ease;
	}
	.preview-trigger:hover .preview-hint { transform: translateY(-2px); background: var(--blue); }
	.preview-dialog {
		width: 100vw;
		max-width: none;
		height: 100vh;
		max-height: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		border: 0;
		background: #f7f4ef;
	}
	.preview-dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(11,36,71,.82); }
	.preview-toolbar {
		position: sticky;
		z-index: 2;
		top: 0;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		min-height: 60px;
		padding: 10px clamp(18px, 3vw, 42px);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11,36,71,.12);
		background: rgba(255,255,255,.94);
		backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
	}
	.preview-toolbar p {
		color: var(--blue-deep);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.preview-close {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 9px;
		padding: 8px 13px;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
		background: #fff;
		color: var(--blue-deep);
		font: 700 .8rem var(--font-body);
		cursor: pointer;
	}
	.preview-close span { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1; }
	.preview-canvas {
		display: grid;
		place-items: start center;
		min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);
		padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 44px);
		overflow: auto;
	}
	.preview-canvas img {
		width: min(1900px, 100%);
		height: auto;
		box-shadow: 0 22px 70px -38px rgba(11,36,71,.7);
	}
	.project-content { padding: 104px 0; background: var(--panel); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.project-content-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
		gap: clamp(52px, 7vw, 80px);
		align-items: start;
	}
	.project-content .section-head { margin-bottom: 0; }
	.project-content h2, .project-features h2, .project-cta h2 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.3rem);
	}
	.project-copy {
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		padding-top: 58px;
	}
	.project-copy p { margin-bottom: 18px; line-height: 1.75; }
	.project-copy .project-intro { color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.18rem; }
	.project-features { padding: 104px 0; }
	.compact-head { max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 42px; }
	.feature-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 22px; }
	.feature-cards article {
		padding: 30px;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		background: var(--panel);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	}
	.feature-cards article > span {
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 24px;
		color: var(--gold);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 800;
	}
	.feature-cards h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
	.feature-cards p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: .94rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.project-cta { padding: 0 0 110px; }
	.project-cta-card {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
		gap: 50px;
		align-items: end;
		padding: 48px;
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		background: var(--blue-deep);
		color: #fff;
	}
	.project-cta-card h2 { color: #fff; }
	.project-cta-card p { max-width: 600px; margin-top: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
	.project-cta-card .eyebrow { color: var(--blue-deep); }
	.project-cta-card .btn-primary { background: var(--gold); color: var(--blue-deep); }
	.project-cta-card .btn-ghost { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); color: #fff; }
	.project-cta-card .project-actions { margin-top: 0; }
	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.project-hero-grid, .project-content-grid, .project-cta-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.project-hero { padding-top: 70px; }
		.project-facts { max-width: 560px; }
		.project-content-grid { gap: 34px; }
		.project-copy { padding-top: 0; }
		.project-cta-card { gap: 26px; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.project-hero { padding: 54px 0 60px; }
		h1 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 12vw, 2.75rem); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
		.project-actions { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; }
		.project-actions .btn { width: 100%; }
		.project-facts { width: 100%; padding: 5px 20px; }
		.project-facts div { padding: 16px 0; }
		.project-showcase { padding-bottom: 76px; }
		.browser-frame { border-radius: 11px; }
		.browser-bar { height: 40px; padding: 0 10px; gap: 5px; }
		.browser-bar div { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 170px; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
		.preview-hint { right: 10px; bottom: 10px; padding: 8px 11px; font-size: .7rem; }
		.project-content, .project-features { padding: 76px 0; }
		.feature-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.feature-cards article { padding: 24px 20px; }
		.project-cta { padding-bottom: 76px; }
		.project-cta-card { padding: 32px 24px; }
	}
</style>

<style is:global>
	.preview-dialog {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100vw;
		max-width: none;
		height: 100dvh;
		max-height: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		border: 0;
		border-radius: 0;
		outline: 0;
		background: #f7f4ef;
		color: var(--ink);
		box-shadow: none;
	}

	.preview-dialog[open] {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.preview-dialog::backdrop {
		background: rgba(11, 36, 71, .76);
	}

	.preview-dialog .preview-toolbar {
		position: sticky;
		z-index: 2;
		top: 0;
		flex: 0 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		min-height: 64px;
		padding: 10px clamp(18px, 3vw, 42px);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11, 36, 71, .12);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .96);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -22px rgba(11, 36, 71, .65);
		backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
	}

	.preview-dialog .preview-toolbar p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--blue-deep);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.preview-dialog .preview-close {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 9px;
		padding: 8px 13px;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
		outline-offset: 3px;
		background: #fff;
		color: var(--blue-deep);
		font: 700 .8rem var(--font-body);
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.preview-dialog .preview-close span {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.preview-dialog .preview-canvas {
		flex: 1 1 auto;
		display: grid;
		place-items: start center;
		min-height: 0;
		padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 44px);
		overflow: auto;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0, rgba(232, 163, 61, .09), transparent 35rem),
			#f7f4ef;
	}

	.preview-dialog .preview-canvas img {
		display: block;
		width: min(1900px, 100%);
		max-width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		border: 0;
		outline: 0;
		background: #fff;
		box-shadow: 0 24px 64px -38px rgba(11, 36, 71, .55);
	}
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.preview-dialog .preview-toolbar { min-height: 56px; padding: 8px 12px; gap: 12px; }
		.preview-dialog .preview-toolbar p { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
		.preview-dialog .preview-close { flex: 0 0 auto; }
		.preview-dialog .preview-canvas { padding: 8px; }
	}
</style>
